        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert sales call analyst. Your task is to analyze the following call summary and extract key information.\n\nFirst, classify the overall customer intent into one of three categories: \"interested\", \"not_interested\", or \"neutral\".\n\nSecond, if and only if the intent is \"interested\", determine the specific follow-up action requested by the customer. The follow-up action must be one of the following: \"book_meeting\", \"send_whatsapp\", or \"send_email\".\n\nIf the user appears interested in a virtual tour or scheduling a call or meeting, regardless of their preferred contact methods, the follow-up action should be “book_meeting”.\n\nThird, if the follow-up action is \"book_meeting\", extract the specific details mentioned for the meeting (e.g., \"Tomorrow at 3 p.m.\").\n\nYou must provide your response ONLY as a single JSON object. The JSON object must have three keys: \"intent\", \"follow_up_method\", and \"meeting_details\".\n- \"intent\" must be one of \"interested\", \"not_interested\", or \"neutral\".\n- \"follow_up_method\" must be one of \"send_whatsapp\", \"send_email\", \"book_meeting\", or null if the intent is not 'interested'.\n- \"meeting_details\" must be a string containing the meeting time, or null if no meeting was discussed.\n\nHere are some examples of perfect responses:\n- For a lead who wants to schedule a call: {\"intent\": \"interested\", \"follow_up_method\": \"book_meeting\", \"meeting_details\": \"Tomorrow at 3 p.m.\"}\n- For a lead who asks for a brochure via WhatsApp: {\"intent\": \"interested\", \"follow_up_method\": \"send_whatsapp\", \"meeting_details\": null}\n- For a lead who is not interested: {\"intent\": \"not_interested\", \"follow_up_method\": null, \"meeting_details\": null}\n- For a lead who said they are busy: {\"intent\": \"neutral\", \"follow_up_method\": null, \"meeting_details\": null}\n\nHere is the call summary to analyze:\n{{ $('Respond from Retell').item.json.body.call.call_analysis.call_summary }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {
          "temperature": 1
        }
